                    <div class="guide-card">
                        <div class="guide-card-title">路线抉择</div>
                        <div class="guide-card-content">
                            <p><span class="highlight">权谋线</span>：在差事中寻找机会，卷入帝后党争与厂卫倾轧，风险与回报并存。</p>
                            <p><span class="highlight">情感线</span>：<span id="guideEmotion"></span></p>
                            <p><span class="highlight">生存线</span>：低调行事，办好差事攒钱，为出宫做准备。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="guide-card">
                        <div class="guide-card-title">红颜谱</div>
                        <div class="guide-card-content">
                            <p><span class="highlight">后宫主位</span>：太后垂帘听政，妃嫔各怀心思，靠近权力中心意味着杀机四伏，但也可能平步青云。</p>
                            <p><span class="highlight">金枝玉叶</span>：公主各有所好，或可借其势庇护自身。</p>
                            <p><span class="highlight">女官宫人</span>：<span id="guideOfficer"></span></p>
                            <p><span class="highlight">奇人异士</span>：精怪异类、外邦贡女等非常之人，或可结为隐秘助力。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="guide-card">
                        <div class="guide-card-title">生存法则</div>
                        <div class="guide-card-content">
                            <p id="guideLaw"></p>
                            <p><span class="highlight">差事</span>是主要日常，办好差事可升官发财。</p>
                            <p><span class="highlight">派系</span>站队需谨慎，后党与齐党利益一致，帝党与东南党暗通款曲。</p>
                            <p><span class="highlight">钱财</span>可通神，月俸微薄，灰色收入是生存之道。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
